 888+ 09BC              ; Unified guest memory interface
 889+ 09BC              ;
 890+ 09BC              ; Guest physical address is classified before selecting its physical backing:
 891+ 09BC              ;   00000-9FFFF / C8000-FDFFF : guest RAM, pages 44h-83h
